      "escalated": false,
      "escalation": null,
      "final_text": "I implemented all four T1 features and pushed them as f7e8e0a679dc. The full suite passes locally (6 tests), but the push has not linked yet. It is in a 24s consent window and I haven't waited for the result.\n\n- **Unicode slugs:** `slugify` now normalises to NFC, lowercases, and turns every run of non-alphanumeric characters into one hyphen.\n- **Tags:** `new --tag`, `tag SLUG TAG...` and `list --tag` all work as specified. `show` now prints the note file exactly as stored.\n- **Rename and search:** `rename` keeps tags and body and applies the `-2`/`-3` suffix when the new slug is taken by another note. `search` is case-insensitive over title and body and prints `No matches.` when nothing hits.\n- **`gc` fix (not in the task text):** `gc` only accepted ASCII slugs, so it would have deleted notes with non-ASCII slugs. It now treats any `.md` file whose name is already a valid slug as a note.\n- **Tests:** I added `tests/test_features.py`. One end-to-end test covers tags, `list --tag`, rename, search, `gc` and the unknown-slug error.",
